@page "/control-your-money"

<h3 class="pb-1">Control Your Money</h3>

<div class="p-2 border rounded ml-2">
    <p>
        Money is hard. You have it, then you don't have it.
    </p>
    <p>
        Where does it come from?
    </p>
    <p>
        More importantly: where does it go?
    </p>
    <p>
        The answers seem easy. But...
    </p>
    <p>
        Where <em>does</em> the money go?
    </p>
    <p>
        <em>What do I have to show for it</em>?
    </p>
    <p>
        I asked myself these questions for far too long. I finally took action.
    </p>
    <p>
        What I'm sharing here is not anything special or even especially difficult. It's a simple way of thinking about your income and spending
        that empowers you to take control.
    </p>
    <p>
        You can do this.
    </p>
    <p>
        <a href="remeter-me">Remeter yourself</a> today.
    </p>
</div>
